        "teacherMoves": "Ask: \"What can we now add to our model that we could not show in Lesson 5?\" WAIT TIME 10-15 seconds. Cold-call 3 learners to propose one addition each and ask the class to agree or add on. Prompt: \"Which part of the histogram best shows the danger near the school gate? What would you say to Ms Halima Abdi and Mzee Otieno using this graph?\" Remind learners that this is a one-morning sample (Tuesday, 6:30-7:30 am) and should be repeated. Link ahead: \"Next lesson we will draw frequency polygons and compare with Mombasa Road.\" Collect one model annotation per group.",
